        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 251, Imperial Egret Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia 251 Ornate Egret Door Lever features luxurious embellishments on the handle and the rose. This Imperial Egret Lever is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. At first glance, the bird depicted on the Omnia's 251 Door Lever might not be obvious, but that is what makes it such a special piece. It rewards those who are willing to look a little closer; and who wouldn't want a second look at this beautiful lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Imperial Egret Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 251 Egret Door Lever::\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LCN-4041T-size.gif?v=1704354722\" width=\"301\" height=\"120\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Egret Door Lever",
                "description": "Omnia 251/00 Ornate Door Lever - Fit for royalty, this Omnia made door lever features luxurious embellishments on the handle and the rose. This latchset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors.",
                "keywords": "Omnia 251 Ornate Leverset s, OMN-251/00, Ornate Leversets, solid brass door levers, fancy door handles, ornate door lever latchsets, omnia ornate door handles, fancy door latchsets, Omnia 251/00 Lever Latchset, omnia fancy door levers, ornate door levers, solid brass door handles, Omnia fancy floral door levers, ornate solid brass latchsets, 251/00 Omnia Lever, imperial egret levers,"
